[
  {
    "text": "日",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.422265607405599,
      "width": 0.027126047241415485,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "常生",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.44693278514696694,
      "width": 0.046029660838487745,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "活",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.49087769145303434,
      "width": 0.024293062773740735,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的织",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.5130859996943549,
      "width": 0.046346845267562976,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "锦",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.5574741509077198,
      "width": 0.02428899630670129,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "日常生活的织锦",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2203267323561774,
      "left": 0.3395833191840278,
      "width": 0.32083333600694375,
      "height": 0.032738093874007924
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "每个星期六早上6点30分,第一批顾客还没到,河湾",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.31802307279945313,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208285906592241,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市场的摊主们就已经开始卸货了。这个市场自1948年",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3537373570256436,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208036073269318,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "起就开在杨树街的四个街区上,据老街坊说,七十多",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.38796354607574274,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208171489930344,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年来从未停过一个星期。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4236778303019332,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.3359580787788293,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "如今这里大约有140个摊位,而十年前只有85个。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.45790401935203245,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.6780453030668613,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "根据市政府2023年的调查,市场在普通周末能吸引约",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4936183035782229,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.720826748159301,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "12000名顾客,每年为本地经济带来约420万元的收入",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.527844492628322,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208132696181959,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "(周边的咖啡馆和小店还不算在内)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5635587768545126,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.4886662849159873,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5635587768545126,
      "left": 0.620614181571283,
      "width": 0.022906235642448456,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "“大家都以为我们卖的是蔬菜,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5977849659046117,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.4220979120646697,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”在这里摆了27年菜",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5977849659046117,
      "left": 0.5971521561947009,
      "width": 0.26324799989904124,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "摊的王秀兰说,“其实我们卖的是一个让人愿意进城的",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6334992501308022,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208117425349264,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "理由。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6677254391809013,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.09596912586170292,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”她说,卖得最好",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6677254391809013,
      "left": 0.22900306674258017,
      "width": 0.23884759154072482,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的还是两块钱一袋的什锦青",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6677254391809013,
      "left": 0.4700227214573857,
      "width": 0.3903932019273659,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "菜。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.703439723407092,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.061083307731945403,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数据也印证了她",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7376659124571912,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.21553998004625036,
      "height": 0.021815474983878966
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的说法。赶集日的人流量比其他星",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7376659124571912,
      "left": 0.3981881290338273,
      "width": 0.4622045253935604,
      "height": 0.021815474983878966
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "期六高出38%,四分之三的顾客表示,他们还顺便去",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7718921015072904,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208008721187127,
      "height": 0.021815474983878966
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "了附近的其他店铺。省立大学的经济学家李明教授把",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8076063857334809,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208171489930344,
      "height": 0.021815474983878966
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "这种现象称",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8418325747835801,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.15270823141424006,
      "height": 0.021815474983878966
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "为“溢出效应”。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8418325747835801,
      "left": 0.29229153365451893,
      "width": 0.2160515629416012,
      "height": 0.021815474983878966
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "1",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.9371898299249443,
      "left": 0.49554035435248434,
      "width": 0.00890554157379613,
      "height": 0.0158630942795139
    },
